/* 16 of the 66 cartridge anims have every slot empty. That is a DECISION in the
   ROM, not a gap in the decode: the spawn wrapper skips a zero source_id
   (RAM 0x801FC884) and there is no fallback source anywhere in it. They are:
   FBALL1, MUZZLE_FLASH, SMOKE_M, ION_CANNON, CRATE_DEVIATOR, CRATE_DOLLAR, CRATE_EARTH, CRATE_EMPULSE, CRATE_INVUN, CRATE_MINE, CRATE_RAPID, CRATE_STEALTH, CRATE_MISSILE, ATOM_DOOR, MOVE_FLASH, OILFIELD_BURN. */

